<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- qvr_doom.dll: Doom on the wrist gadget (docs/vr-port/DOOM.md), built from the vendored doomgeneric
     (Quake/vr/external/doomgeneric, GPL-2; its QVR_DOOM patches: README.QVR.md there) and its glue
     (Quake/vr/doom/qvr_doom_dll.c). A DLL of its own, loaded by vr_doom.cpp on first use: Doom's globals (Z_Malloc,
     I_Error, M_Init, ...) never meet Quake's. Output beside ironwail.exe. C, clang-cl as the engine; the static C runtime
     (its files closed with _fcloseall at shutdown without touching the engine's), Doom's own warnings off (upstream's code). -->
